{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47512","headline":"七言 二十一 · 吕岩","name":"七言 二十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"黄芽白雪两飞金，行即高歌醉即吟。\n日月暗扶君甲子，乾坤自与我知音。\n精灵灭迹三清剑，风雨腾空一弄琴。\n的当南游归甚处，莫交鹤去上天寻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47512.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47512","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}